    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soulless and forgotten. Shadows of the damned playing a game where each call could be their last. Do you dare to take a seat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into this <strong>first-person multiplayer game</strong>, sit down at the table and try your best at different game modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Death Sum</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aim for the lowest cards set. Make a call at anytime but watch out as you may be the one endangered... Make use of some helpful items to disturb your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Trust Wish</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can't see your death but others can. Talk to your enemies and make them trust you. But do you trust them?</p>",
